.Dd November 17, 2026
.Dt TABS 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm tabs
.Nd set terminal tab stops
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl c
.Op Fl T Ar type
.Op Ar stop ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility writes ANSI escapes that clear and set tab stops at the given
1-based columns.
The default stop list is every eight columns through 80.
The
.Fl c
option emits cursor-motion escapes instead of setting stops, and
.Fl T
accepts a terminal type (the implementation is ANSI only).
.Pp
The historical
.Fl a , f , p , s
and
.Fl u
styles and
.Sy +m
are not supported and produce a usage error.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 on success and 2 on usage errors.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr tput 1
